<!--
  The English source of the app's text, for Android and iOS (docs/translating.md).

  A translation is values-<language>/strings.xml with the same names (values-nl, values-pt-rBR).
  A string left out there shows in English. A comment above a string is for translators.
  Names are lower_snake_case and start with the part of the app they belong to.
-->
